MEGA65 (model $03), 384K chip RAM, 8MB attic RAM

>10 REM ON OBJEVENT: the handler runs between statements after a kill (manual steps)
>20 OBJUPDATE:EC%=0:ON OBJEVENT PROCev:OBJECT 3,10,10,0:OBJVEL 3,0,0:OBJLIFE 3,2:OBJLIMITS 0,0,0,100,100,3:OBJECT 4,98,10,0:OBJVEL 4,5,0:OBJBOUNDS 4,0
>30 FOR F%=1 TO 4:OBJUPDATE:PRINT F%;" ";EC%;" ";L$:NEXT
>40 ON OBJEVENT OFF:OBJECT 5,10,10,0:OBJVEL 5,0,0:OBJLIFE 5,1:OBJUPDATE:PRINT "off ";EC%;" ";OBJEVENT(5)
>50 END
>60 DEF PROCev:LOCAL N%:EC%=EC%+1:N%=OBJEVENT(-1):L$="":REPEAT:L$=L$+STR$N%+" ":IF OBJEVENT(N%) THEN N%=OBJEVENT(-1)
>70 UNTIL N%<0:ENDPROC
>RUN
         1 1 4 
         2 2 3 
         3 2 3 
         4 2 3 
off 2 -1
>
